      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does CONFIG_BATTERY_PHYSICAL_PRESENCE mean \"battery can be removed\" or just \"we have a way to tell if the battery is present\"?",
      "revId": "eabb9a669cfc270b3d4cdbd4b0d35a9a08a4cee2",
