      "lineNbr": 177,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000144
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-07-16T13:46:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It means that we have a way to tell that the battery is connected without needing to talk to it over smbus. If we had a device with an external battery then something like CONFIG_BATTERY_REMOVABLE would be appropriate (and orthogonal to this config option).\n\nI can\u0027t say I\u0027m enamored with the current name. How about CONFIG_BATTERY_DETECT instead? It\u0027s more to the point.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAcX//+vU\u003d",
      "revId": "eabb9a669cfc270b3d4cdbd4b0d35a9a08a4cee2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
